{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 180,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people don't know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the real story of Alfred Nobel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3470,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4920,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One morning in 1888,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6690,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred Nobel sat down\nto read the newspaper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8850,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in his conservatory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10590,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He scanned the pages casually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12750,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then, he froze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15150,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Merchant of Death is dead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17700,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Alfred Nobel, who\nbecame rich by finding ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20730,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to kill more people faster than\never before, died yesterday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25320,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was his own obituary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28170,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The newspaper had made a mistake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30420,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred's older brother\nLudwig had died in France,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33390,
    "dDurationMs": 2565,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the journalists had confused the two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35955,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36788,
    "dDurationMs": 2692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in that moment, he saw exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39480,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how the world would remember\nhim, not as an inventor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43110,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as a butcher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46080,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the wording in the\nobituary, the Merchant of Death"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48990,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all that, well, it's\nlikely been exaggerated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51600,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52680,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We could only find an obituary\nthat described him as a man"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55500,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who can hardly be passed off\nas a benefactor of humanity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58860,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But reading this allowed Alfred to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61500,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what others truly thought\nof him, and it wasn't good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65430,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had earned his reputation\nbuilding an empire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67980,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on one substance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70020,
    "dDurationMs": 933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71910,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's one of the most powerful\nexplosives in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75060,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its blast pressure is over 100\ntimes greater than gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79622,
    "dDurationMs": 1588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81210,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh my God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82980,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Woo!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83820,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's so sick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85350,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that power comes at a price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87810,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nitroglycerin is so sensitive\nthat if it's dropped, shaken,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91680,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even just bumped, it can detonate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94770,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result, hundreds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96510,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of workers died trying to handle it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99150,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Alfred made it his\nmission to tame this beast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102600,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in doing so, he created\npowerful new explosives used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105840,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in everything from blasting\ntunnels to making bombs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109200,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tools that transformed the modern world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111630,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also contributed to\ndeaths of tens of thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114690,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of people, unleashing\na level of destruction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117300,
    "dDurationMs": 2064,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would come to define him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119364,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(ground rumbles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125580,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred's father, Immanuel\nwas also an inventor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128640,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He opened the first ever\nrubber factory in Sweden"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131310,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and invented the rotary lathe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133290,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which made modern plywood possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136410,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Immanuel struggled with business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138780,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He went bankrupt shortly\nafter Alfred was born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Immanuel set off to\nRussia to start over,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144000,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaving his family behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147330,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of Alfred's earliest memories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149100,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were of watching his brothers sell matches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151230,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the street corners of\nStockholm just to afford food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155160,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was often sick, bedridden\nwith colds, stomach problems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158910,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and bouts of depression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160740,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He would later say, \"Mine\nwas a pitiful half-life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164040,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which ought to have been extinguished"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165600,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by some compassionate doctor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167130,
    "dDurationMs": 2247,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as I yelled my way into the world.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170970,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But soon after Alfred turned nine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172920,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a letter arrived from his\nfather asking the family"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175260,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to join him in St. Petersburg."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177420,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the early 1850s, the great powers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179970,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Europe were gearing up for war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182220,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Immanuel spotted an opportunity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184740,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He realized Russia's\ncapital was vulnerable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187020,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to attack from the sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188490,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he approached Tsar\nNicholas I with plans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191040,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a new kind of explosive device,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192870,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that would float in the harbor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194310,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and detonate on contact with enemy ships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197160,
    "dDurationMs": 1219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A sea mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198379,
    "dDurationMs": 1211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199590,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within months of his\nproposal in the Black Sea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201870,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just off Sinope, the Russian\nNavy sank an ottoman fleet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205470,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the Crimean war began."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208020,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immanuel's invention was\nsuddenly in high demand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210930,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the newly established\nNobel armaments factory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213630,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quickly grew from a few dozen employees"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215910,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to over 1,000, producing mines, torpedoes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219090,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and other explosives for\nthe Russian military."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222900,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With money now pouring\nin, Immanuel decided"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226140,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to invest in Alfred's education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228600,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the age of 17,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230010,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred found himself in a lab in Paris"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232230,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "studying under the\nworld's greatest chemists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234870,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's here that he\nmet an Italian doctor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237270,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "named Ascanio Sobrero who\nhad a peculiar demonstration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242760,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sobrero would take an ordinary\nlooking piece of cotton"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245760,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lay it on an anvil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247560,
    "dDurationMs": 2284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He would raise his hammer and."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249844,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mysterious music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254865,
    "dDurationMs": 2865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Whoa. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257730,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a bird ran into a window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260704,
    "dDurationMs": 1614,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That was a good one, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262318,
    "dDurationMs": 1742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, that was a great one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264060,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Soaked into that cotton"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265410,
    "dDurationMs": 3357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a new explosive\nmaterial, nitroglycerin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268767,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was unlike anything the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270630,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had ever seen before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272220,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, until then, the most\ncommonly used explosive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274950,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276060,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it had a major drawback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278130,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fast, but it's not that fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280560,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we were doing it, it was much slower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282150,
    "dDurationMs": 1883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the speed of sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284033,
    "dDurationMs": 1777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Ah!\n- Jesus!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285810,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's because all the\ningredients you need,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288030,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the carbon for fuel, the\npotassium nitrate for oxygen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291330,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the sulfur to speed up the reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293730,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are all in separate grains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296220,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if they're spread far apart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297870,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their reaction is just too slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299400,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on, you can do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301470,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302400,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you contain gunpowder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304350,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that forces these\nreactants closer together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306840,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it also traps in heat,\nwhich accelerates the reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310860,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this allows the\npressure from the hot gases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313260,
    "dDurationMs": 1273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build up until."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314533,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316368,
    "dDurationMs": 1205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(playful music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317573,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You see the explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318807,
    "dDurationMs": 1131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the powder burst out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319938,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No way.\n- And then it catches flames."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321271,
    "dDurationMs": 1139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- You can see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322410,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole bottom comes out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323250,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it just catches up to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324900,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All these particles have\nto be in close proximity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327540,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they also have to be small enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329760,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have to be mixed well enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331830,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get this reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332663,
    "dDurationMs": 2437,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it kinda feels a little bit clunky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335100,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like it's not the ideal\nway you'd wanna do this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337890,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it's like all the molecules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339900,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are actually like right\nnext to each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341760,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's a great instinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343020,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Putting all the molecules\nbeside each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344640,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you'd have them all available"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346230,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to react as quickly as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347550,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think I can one up that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348870,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is, can you\nput everything you need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351420,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the same molecule?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352710,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353543,
    "dDurationMs": 937,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And that's what nitroglycerin does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354480,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No way.\n- Yeah. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355560,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356580,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pretty cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357413,
    "dDurationMs": 1507,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That is way cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358920,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because of that,\nit's way more powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362490,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've loaded 15 grams of gunpowder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364650,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 15 grams of nitroglycerin\ninto test tubes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367560,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then set them in clay blocks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369480,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we can compare their destructive power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371880,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a bikini gauge for\nmeasuring blast over pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376080,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's called the\nbikini gauge in reference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378600,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the bikini atoll"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379830,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because a analog blast over\npressure measurement device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383730,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was used in the nuclear\ntests in the bikini atoll."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387540,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has a number of\ndifferent diameter holes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390630,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a film inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392250,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Narrator] The larger\ncircles have more area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394500,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so under the same pressure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396090,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they will experience more\nforce and so burst first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399870,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The smaller circles take\nmore pressure to break"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402870,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they've got smaller area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404640,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The smaller the circle\nthat gets punctured"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407790,
    "dDurationMs": 2283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means the higher the blast over pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411690,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, black powder into clay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414720,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Fire in the hole!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415830,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420318,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423960,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it launched the block a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425970,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Popped the top right off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428170,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's look at the bikini gauge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429360,
    "dDurationMs": 1556,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which looks totally intact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430916,
    "dDurationMs": 1894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Looks totally intact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432810,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434310,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I'm getting nothing, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435990,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436823,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, we'll see if we'll\nleave that for the nitro."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439590,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the nitroglycerin goes off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441030,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's gonna be like someone\nshooting a 50 cal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443340,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I don't know if\nyou've been to the range,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444630,
    "dDurationMs": 1735,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's gonna be a big blast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446365,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mysterious music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456720,
    "dDurationMs": 1024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fire in the hole!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457744,
    "dDurationMs": 4586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five, four, three, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462330,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464180,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467296,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471450,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first thing I noticed\nis there are bits of clay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473580,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have just rained down on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474810,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got bits of blue all over me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's crazy, right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482700,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there anything left?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483870,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, there is a\nbunch of clay on this window,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487260,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on that window, on this\nwindow, on bikini gauge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490830,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's like a Jackson Pollock painting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493070,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mysterious music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497280,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no way we've got a frame there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501000,
    "dDurationMs": 1963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just instant white."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502963,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Joosh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506280,
    "dDurationMs": 2097,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it's fast on the\nphantom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508377,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it's fast.\n- (laughs) Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512820,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nitroglycerin is incredibly powerful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514920,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it gets this power from\nits molecular structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517860,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, nitroglycerin is a\nhighly unstable molecule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520440,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It consists of a chain\nof three carbon atoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522540,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with three oxygens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523830,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then three nitro\ngroups attached to those,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525870,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which are just nitrogen atoms\nbonded to two oxygen atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528960,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These nitro groups are what\nmakes nitroglycerin so unstable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532260,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oxygen is more\nelectronegative than nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534900,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these two oxygen atoms\npull on the electrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537270,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the nitrogen, which shifts\nthe electron density away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from this third oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541350,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now there's little\nshared electron density"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543210,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between these two atoms, which\nresults in a much weaker bond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545940,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between the nitro groups\nand the main chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547830,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you get these weak spots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549690,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all it takes is a\nlittle bit of energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551370,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like from the shock\ncreated by hammer strike"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553530,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then those bonds snap apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555570,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now you've got all these atoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556680,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are swapping partners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557820,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they form much more stable\nproducts like nitrogen gas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560790,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carbon dioxide, and water vapor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562590,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this process releases a\nhuge amount of energy and heat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565320,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it shoots off the\nproducts at high velocities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567660,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then these go on to hit\nother nitroglycerin molecules,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569910,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which causes their bonds to break."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571530,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if this happens for\nenough molecules at once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573480,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, it sets off a chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576180,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now you've got a shockwave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577140,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now it's going to propagate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578250,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as it propagates through,\nit's gonna break bonds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580830,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here, here, here, here, here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582270,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Henry] Its blast pressure\nis over 100 times greater than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585060,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the peak pressures that\nare produced by gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588600,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Lots of things will explode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589680,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even, you know, you pop a\nballoon and that's an explosion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592650,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the specific kind of\nexplosion we're interested in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595170,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with nitroglycerin is a detonation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597780,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the detonation is that\nchemical decomposition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600570,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that happens faster than the\nspeed of sound in the material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603960,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What we see in our experiments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605160,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with nitroglycerin is all these\nthings happen really fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609300,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like less than 100 femtoseconds fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611970,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't operate in femtosecond\nseconds very frequently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615030,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How fast is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616350,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Well, femtosecond 10\nto negative 15 seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618870,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620550,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a molecule of\nnitroglycerin will decompose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623070,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3 trillion times faster\nthan the blink of an eye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627240,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's this speed that is one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628470,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the defining characteristics\nof high explosives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631830,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yet, Sobrero never set out\nto discover an explosive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635760,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was searching for a\nmedicine to improve blood flow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640230,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During one test, he mixed\nglycerol with nitric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642480,
    "dDurationMs": 2635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sulfuric acid, when\nsuddenly, it exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645115,
    "dDurationMs": 995,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sobrero survived but shards of glass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648750,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "left permanent scars on his face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651270,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Deeply shaken, he concluded\nthis new substance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654120,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nitroglycerin, was just too dangerous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657150,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He later wrote, \"I am\nalmost ashamed to admit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660060,
    "dDurationMs": 1257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be its discoverer.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662940,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Alfred disagreed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665130,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To him, the hammer strike\nwas like a pistol shot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668850,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like somebody had kicked\nopen the door to his mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672690,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's a real shift in his character."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674520,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause he is been this frail, sickly boy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676590,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of has trouble with people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677970,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then he discovers\nexplosives and chemistry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680940,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682020,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, it's like\nwhenever he is working,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683220,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he finally isn't depressed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684630,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, he can kind of\nescape through his work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686550,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And you know, at that age,\nyou're probably not thinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688800,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about all the possible\nconsequences of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690720,
    "dDurationMs": 3183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're just sort of excited\nabout what it can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695520,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Far from fearing its power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697500,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he believed he'd be the one to unlock it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700110,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and solve one of nitroglycerin's\ngreatest problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703650,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If I had a jar sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705180,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right here and I wanted to\ndetonate it, how do I do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708660,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Need a long fuse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710760,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But what's crazy about nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712200,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that a regular flame\nwon't cause it to ignite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715680,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even if I ran a fuse into that vial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718770,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not gonna explode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720240,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, while a fuse can heat nitroglycerin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722040,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which makes its molecules vibrate faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724200,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it might even break a few no bonds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726300,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it usually doesn't break\nenough of them at the same time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728490,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to detonate the rest of the liquid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729870,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it doesn't explode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731370,
    "dDurationMs": 2312,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, if you drop it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733682,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737640,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even that effect isn't consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742320,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We tried putting a vial loose\nin the back of this RC truck,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744990,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expecting the bumpy ride to trigger it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748209,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(playful music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752612,
    "dDurationMs": 1528,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754140,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Whoa!\n- Ah!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756170,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It always seems to be blowing up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757770,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you don't want it to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758603,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can't really get it to\nblow up when you want it to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761250,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's very paradoxical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764272,
    "dDurationMs": 2273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766545,
    "dDurationMs": 2865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- (laughs) You know, my browser"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769410,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used to look like a blast site too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770790,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had windows and tabs\nscattered like debris."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772980,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had YouTube, Wikipedia,\nrandom research articles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776670,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some things that I swear I never opened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780150,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that changed when I switched"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781650,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to today's video sponsor, Opera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783510,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With its free built-in AI tool, Aria,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785340,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can use the quick\nshortcut to write a prompt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787170,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the chaos is gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788580,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can say close all my\nYouTube tabs and it's done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791460,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or I can say, group my chemistry papers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793200,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it creates this tab island."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794970,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can even hover one tab over another tab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797190,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boom, another island."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798540,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can expand and collapse\nthem as needed to save"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800610,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "space and stay organized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802260,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also love that I can ask\nAria anything while researching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804450,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, what year did Alfred Nobel\npatent dynamite in England?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807450,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I get the answer instantly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808590,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without having to switch tabs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810000,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really helpful when\nDerek is patiently waiting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812520,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the next version\nof my script. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816930,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I'm going through an\narticle and wanna take notes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818730,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can just drag one tab down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820050,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "split the screen, and now I can do both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821880,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No need for multiple browser windows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823740,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I feel like listening to some music"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825210,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the background, Opera's\ngot a floating music player"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827250,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built into the sidebar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828360,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes controlling my music easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829770,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can access my favorite\nstreaming service from anywhere,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831810,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even while leaving the browser."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833700,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want a browser that\nhelps you get stuff done,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835920,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try opera for free by clicking\nthe link in our description,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838380,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thanks to opera for sponsoring this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839940,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, back to some\nexplosions. (mimics explosion)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843360,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In 1852, when Alfred returned to Russia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845940,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he moved into a cramped apartment\nwith his brother Robert,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848880,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he turned their kitchen\ninto a makeshift lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852120,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was searching for a reliable way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853980,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to detonate nitroglycerin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855540,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dreaming it could one day\npower his father's sea mines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859260,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when the Crimean war ended in 1856,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862020,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Russian government refused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863580,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to honor the contracts\nthey'd signed during the war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866370,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the Nobel factory\nwas forced to shut down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869130,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Immanuel went bankrupt\nfor the second time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873000,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred later wrote that\nhis father was, quote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875017,
    "dDurationMs": 3683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"A man of genius, but a\nfailure all the same.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878700,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so Alfred goes back to Sweden"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880950,
    "dDurationMs": 1747,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he decides, he's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882697,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I'm not gonna make the\nmistakes of my father.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885600,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where does his mind go?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886920,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sticking with nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's like, \"If I can make this, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889350,
    "dDurationMs": 1917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll be successful on my own terms.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894930,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the summer of 1862,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896563,
    "dDurationMs": 3077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a 28-year-old Alfred thought\nhe was onto something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899640,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Excited, he gathered his brothers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901560,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the banks of Lake Malaren"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903090,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just behind his workshop in Stockholm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905310,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he pulled out a metal tube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907080,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a fuse extending from the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909210,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He ignited it and tossed\nit into the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912585,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914805,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Henry laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919107,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920640,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had finally found a way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921960,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reliably detonate nitroglycerin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924360,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and its finished form, it\nworks something like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927030,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred took a container of nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929310,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and inserted a wooden plug\nand packed it with gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932400,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then when the fuse was lit, the gunpowder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934230,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside would explode, blasting\ndown into the container."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937440,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was that sudden impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938610,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that delivered the shock needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939720,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to detonate the nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941430,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was just like the\nhammer striking the anvil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946380,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need a blasting cap for this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948690,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, so now Jesse's\ngonna add a blasting cap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950730,
    "dDurationMs": 2348,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred Nobel's first major adventure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953078,
    "dDurationMs": 2092,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(excited music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955170,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could just like, my heart is\njust racing more than usual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957690,
    "dDurationMs": 2153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I know that it's safe, but yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959843,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually didn't really expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960676,
    "dDurationMs": 1342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to feel this nervous about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962018,
    "dDurationMs": 1365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Fire in the hole!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963383,
    "dDurationMs": 1672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fire in the hole!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965055,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fire in the hole!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968550,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five, four, three, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972540,
    "dDurationMs": 1215,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973755,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh my god."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974815,
    "dDurationMs": 2153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976968,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeez. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978649,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] Stay down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979482,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980315,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981148,
    "dDurationMs": 1142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gotta say that, okay,\ngotta clear the wrench."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982290,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All clear!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983970,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh my God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985050,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] All right, Henry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986100,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, how do you like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987280,
    "dDurationMs": 1613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Geez, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988893,
    "dDurationMs": 2844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991737,
    "dDurationMs": 3023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mysterious music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994760,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] Is that what you came for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996180,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, yeah, for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997170,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was insane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998550,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Look at how it carved out\nthe exact imprint of the bottle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002570,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a foot and a half below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004520,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, look, we even have puncture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006500,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the second to last hole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008180,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The smallest is not punctured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009950,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Henry] Yeah. Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010850,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I mean, that's the entire range"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012980,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of our measurement capability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014540,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016310,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna get you\nthrough through. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018710,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's awesome. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021080,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His invention, the\nblasting cap, was refined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023990,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to use an even more consistent\nexplosive than gunpowder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027200,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mercury fulminate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028970,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It became the first reliable way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030710,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to detonate nitroglycerin on command."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033110,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The design was so effective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034340,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it remained virtually\nunchanged for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037430,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it'd be hard to\nargue that this advancement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039650,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't find its place into every other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041570,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "explosive device that\ncomes after it basically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043430,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Probably the most\nsignificant development"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045050,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since the invention of gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046790,
    "dDurationMs": 1831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The same idea, using a small explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048621,
    "dDurationMs": 3719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to trigger a much larger\none would later be used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052340,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in atomic bombs to set off\nnuclear chain reactions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056360,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the invention of\nthe blasting cap, the use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058910,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of nitroglycerin finally became practical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061640,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It can break rock and make\ntunnels much more effectively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066410,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nitroglycerin sped up\nindustrial excavation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069950,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In one mind, the rate of\ntunneling almost doubled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072410,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from 0.76 to 1.34 meters per day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075740,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in Mexico, crews reported"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077270,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that 15 men using\nnitroglycerin could do the work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079970,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of 25 with gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081950,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So orders started pouring\nin from mining companies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084740,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineers, and railway\nbuilders from around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088580,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To meet the sudden demand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090170,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred began producing\nnitroglycerin in Sweden,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092750,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enlisting the help of his\nyounger brother, Emil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096290,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on the 3rd of September,\n1864, an intern asked Emil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100220,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for help moving a heavy crate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102560,
    "dDurationMs": 4092,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The two began to lift when suddenly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106652,
    "dDurationMs": 2148,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108800,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the factory was ripped apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110810,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113600,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A witness wrote this of the explosion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116127,
    "dDurationMs": 1703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Most ghastly was the sight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117830,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the mutilated corpses\nstrewn on the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120590,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only had their clothes been torn off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122600,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but on some, the head was missing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124760,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the flesh ripped off the bones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127220,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These formless masses of\nflesh and bone bore little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130700,
    "dDurationMs": 2817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or no resemblance to a human body.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134630,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Emil, just 21 years old and four others,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137810,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the intern, a janitor, a young laborer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140270,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a passing carpenter\nall died in the explosion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145220,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred blamed himself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147500,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he swore, \"I will never\nlet this happen again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150590,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will make nitroglycerin safe.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152824,
    "dDurationMs": 3316,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156140,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The city of Stockholm declared\nnitroglycerin too dangerous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159530,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and banned its production\nwithin city limits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162260,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred, however, refused to give up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165080,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is a moment where\nhe's actually a pretty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166700,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "savvy entrepreneur."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168080,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He says, \"Okay, if I'm\nnot gonna do it on land,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170120,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna do it on the water.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171800,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he set up a laboratory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173450,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a floating barge on Lake Malaren."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175850,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as he was experimenting, another one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178070,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of his factories in Germany exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180560,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred was fighting a ticking clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183080,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With every day that passed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184520,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more lives were lost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186620,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Workers were terrified."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188810,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No sane agent would use it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190910,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A mining publication reported\nwe confidently expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194450,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within 30 days to announce\nanother serious accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198830,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, he had addressed the\nproblem of detonation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201290,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not nitroglycerin's\nfundamental sensitivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204080,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because nitroglycerin is so\nviscous, tiny bubbles of air"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207410,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and water vapor easily get trapped inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209870,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As we zoom in, you'll\nnotice there are even more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212720,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These gases are a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214790,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a shockwave reaches\na bubble, it squeezes it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217460,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compressing the gas and heating it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219860,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it happens so fast\nthat the heat can escape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222350,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the temperature inside can increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224180,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by thousands of degrees\nCelsius in an instant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227270,
    "dDurationMs": 1323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It creates a hotspot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229520,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gas molecules in these\nhotspots carry so much energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232250,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they break the weak N-O bonds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234110,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the nitroglycerin molecules nearby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236030,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so these molecules then decompose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238100,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "releasing even more hot gases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240320,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But nitroglycerin doesn't just\nhave one of these bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242930,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's filled with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244670,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's what makes it\nso sensitive to shock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246860,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A single impact can collapse\nmany bubbles at once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1249920,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which releases enough energy\nto trigger the chain reaction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252590,
    "dDurationMs": 1611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that detonates the entire liquid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1254201,
    "dDurationMs": 2949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257150,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you might think to\nmake nitroglycerin safe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred just has to get rid\nof those bubbles, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261860,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it's not that easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264260,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You have an air bubble trap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266150,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's like really hard to get that out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268010,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without like starting\nto, you know, bang on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270230,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you don't wanna do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271580,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you don't want it to go off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274250,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But even if you could\nremove every single bubble,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276710,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would still have a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278300,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because nitroglycerin\nis a lot like the liquid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280790,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this beer bottle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282140,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I replaced it with water.\nAnd you can see, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284270,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there aren't many bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285380,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if I give it a smack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287150,
    "dDurationMs": 1067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bottle shatters)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288217,
    "dDurationMs": 2293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa! (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290510,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The impact drives the bottom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291920,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the beer bottle down faster\nthan the liquid can follow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294830,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which creates this sudden pressure drop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297200,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that drop of vaporizes the liquid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299120,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and creates bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301370,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the liquid rushes back in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302750,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those bubbles then collapse violently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304940,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those implosions sometimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306320,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "release enough energy to crack the glass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308990,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, a similar thing can\nhappen in nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311330,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A strong impact can create new bubbles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313130,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside the liquid in a\nprocess called cavitation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316370,
    "dDurationMs": 3716,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And their collapse again\ntriggers the same chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320086,
    "dDurationMs": 1444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(excited music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321530,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Alfred realized that the only way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323810,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the bubble problem\nwas to change the state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326420,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of nitroglycerin from a liquid to a solid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330530,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Working on his barge in Germany,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332360,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he tried mixing in powdered\ncharcoal, sand, wood shavings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336740,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brick dust and cement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338660,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but nothing really worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341556,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sullen music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343520,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dejected, he looked down and\nnoticed something strange,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346730,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fine powder whispering around his feet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349820,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he looked up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351110,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and saw the same pale threads drifting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353420,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the banks of the Elbe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356270,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Millions of years earlier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357890,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that dust had actually been\nliving organisms, diatoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362690,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Single-celled algae that\nonce floated in ancient seas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366890,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now, in the dunes above the river,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369140,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all that remained were their\nfossilized exoskeletons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372290,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That made for a fine silica\npowder that carried on the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376760,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This material, diatomaceous\nearth or kieselguhr,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380240,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had been appreciated by Darwin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382430,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wrote, \"Few objects are more beautiful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384860,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the minute siliceous\ncases of the diatomaceae.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391070,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Alfred saw beyond their beauty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393560,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the microscopic holes\nin their exoskeletons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396980,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] On the granular level,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398180,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's got lots of little pores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400250,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and places to absorb the liquid into."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403490,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're looking for what\nkind of consistency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405320,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, it's gonna be\nlike a thick and solid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407870,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will make the\nnitroglycerin less sensitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410930,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the same hammer\nimpact that you would try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414200,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with straight nitroglycerin\nwould take more force,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417020,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that absorbent\nmaterial will take some of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419720,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that energy from the impact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421790,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That kind of feels like we're baking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424040,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424873,
    "dDurationMs": 1597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Henry] In fact, kiesleguhr can soak up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426470,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than three times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1427520,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its weight in liquid nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430430,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so if it's porous now, if you mix it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432350,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a nitroglycerin, the nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433700,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can kind of go into the pores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435260,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What that helps do is separate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436970,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the nitroglycerin\nmolecules from each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439250,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And within any individual pore,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441230,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there just isn't enough nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442910,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to propagate the detonation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444830,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now when it's bumped or shaken,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446780,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mixture won't detonate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449150,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we drop it in the exact same way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451130,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that set off the nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452780,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455720,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It didn't go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456770,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457850,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So this new material won't\nexplode when you drop it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460580,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you still detonate it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462320,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if you combine it with\nAlfred's other invention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464450,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the blasting cap, the resulting\nshockwave is powerful enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467270,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to compress many pockets of\nnitroglycerin at the same time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470660,
    "dDurationMs": 2192,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which triggers the detonation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472852,
    "dDurationMs": 1287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474139,
    "dDurationMs": 1771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475910,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] The biggest\nexplosion we've seen up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477080,
    "dDurationMs": 2075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to now is 100 grams of nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479155,
    "dDurationMs": 2658,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Henry] Yeah, it'll be the\nbiggest one we've done so far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483500,
    "dDurationMs": 2735,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] Three, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486235,
    "dDurationMs": 1182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487417,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Henry laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491000,
    "dDurationMs": 1777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Henry] Oh, that's so sick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492777,
    "dDurationMs": 2423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- \"To all whom it may concern, be it known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495200,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I, Alfred Nobel have invented a new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497990,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and useful composition of matter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499880,
    "dDurationMs": 2392,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to wit, an explosive powder.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502272,
    "dDurationMs": 1838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504110,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To name it, he took the Greek\nword dynamis meaning power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508640,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he made it dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511120,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515090,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred was determined to\ncapitalize on his new invention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518450,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he believed that he could make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520130,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most money in England."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522080,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "England is a jewel worth the\nrest of the world, he said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525513,
    "dDurationMs": 1637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A dynamite company there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527150,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have the entire\nempire as its market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530150,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in the spring of 1868,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532310,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he set foot on British soil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carrying with him a suitcase\noverflowing with dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 'Cause he is going around\nand he's inviting journalists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540440,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to come to these demonstrations\nwhere he would bring sticks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542390,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of dynamite in his backpack and a stand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544580,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He would set up these\nhuge boulders, basically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546950,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and put a stick of dynamite in there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548240,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and watch as they like cleft in two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550730,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred was a clever salesman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553580,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when Alfred created dynamite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556490,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nitroglycerin still had\na terrible reputation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558950,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so his initial thought was to name it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561597,
    "dDurationMs": 2153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Nobel's safety powder.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563750,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565100,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566030,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Come on down, get you\na Nobel Safety powder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569120,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Blow the hell out of this rock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1571820,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573020,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever the name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573853,
    "dDurationMs": 2887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His invention came at the perfect time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576740,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around when Alfred introduced dynamite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578660,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there were two other major breakthroughs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581090,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pneumatic drill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582260,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the diamond drilling\ncrown, which now made it easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1585560,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bore holes in solid rock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587810,
    "dDurationMs": 2611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perfect for a stick of dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590421,
    "dDurationMs": 899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591320,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These tools revolutionized construction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594200,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many of the iconic engineering feats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596120,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the era from the Brooklyn Bridge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598280,
    "dDurationMs": 2913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the Panama Canal depended on dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602240,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing that I think\nis really interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603740,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to think about is Russia at the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605990,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't the Russia that we think of now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607790,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was effectively a\nmid-sized European country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610610,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Cause they had this\nvast wealth of resources,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612860,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was cut off by these mountains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614360,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so without dynamite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615770,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you actually wouldn't have\nthe Russia we have today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617900,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause you would've\nnever been able to make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619250,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Trans Siberian Railroad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622670,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's worth saying that\ndynamite is different than TNT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627410,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I was gonna ask\nabout that actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1628850,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trinitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630560,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Trinitrotolu, toluene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633045,
    "dDurationMs": 1055,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tolu?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634100,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Trinitrotoluene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635540,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yup. Trinitrotoluene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637340,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Those nitrogens are bound\nto carbons, not to oxygens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640580,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so that makes it much more stable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643640,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you don't have that really\nweak oxygen nitrogen bond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646940,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because of that, it is much,\nmuch, much less sensitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651560,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652610,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So that actually wouldn't be discovered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654260,
    "dDurationMs": 2517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for another couple decades after dynamite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656777,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The TNT labels on the dynamite sticks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659000,
    "dDurationMs": 1917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Looney Tunes\ncartoons never bothered me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660917,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I watched them as a kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662150,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now I'm just like,\n\"Wait, that's not right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664610,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not TNT in there.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665780,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But the main point is that\ndynamite happened first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668510,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And no matter what ACDC\nsays, it is not TNT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672140,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's a good line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673760,
    "dDurationMs": 1953,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I mean, it's a good track too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676730,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So dynamite was changing the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678980,
    "dDurationMs": 2446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the old dangers of\nnitroglycerin were hard to escape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681426,
    "dDurationMs": 1574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sullen music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1683000,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1869, near Brentford, England,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685490,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a barge carrying dynamite\nexploded on the river Thames,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688670,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "killing three people\nand damaging buildings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690800,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "800 meters away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692750,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Investigators traced the cause to dynamite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694850,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that had been sweating\nbeads of nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698870,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, wet kieselguhr from the\nriverbed has to first be dried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701990,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to remove moisture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703700,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that leaves empty pores\nready to absorb nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707030,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the kieselguhr never loses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708740,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that strong attraction to water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710600,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if your dynamite is\nlater exposed to moisture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1713180,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even just humidity in the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1715040,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but water seeps back into those pores,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717800,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the invading water molecules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1719180,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then encounter nitroglycerin,\nwhich gets pushed outwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722630,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, moisture wasn't the only culprit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724370,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Time and temperature could\nalso cause this separation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1727130,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But moisture just made\nthe problem a lot worse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1729500,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though it actually wasn't\nAlfred's only concern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732800,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, kieselguhr is inert,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734180,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and since dynamite was\nabout 25% kieselguhr,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737120,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that meant it would always\nabsorb a large fraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1739460,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the explosive energy,\nand that power was wasted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742280,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It reduced the strength\nof Alfred's explosive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744410,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ultimately, it hurt his bottom line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747230,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he kept experimenting\nwith new formulations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749690,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and new absorbents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751220,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again and again, he failed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753050,
    "dDurationMs": 2077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he was undeterred saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755127,
    "dDurationMs": 1273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"If I have 1,000 ideas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756400,
    "dDurationMs": 3517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and only one turns out to\nbe good, I am satisfied.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761630,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then one day, while working\nin his home lab in Paris,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764810,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he cut his hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766370,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a pretty deep cut, and\nblood started to pour out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1769730,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he grabbed a bandage,\npressed it to the wound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772070,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and watched it soak up the mess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776240,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That night, the pain woke him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778490,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as he was lying there in the dark,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780530,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "annoyed at his earlier\ncarelessness, his mind drifted back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1783950,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the bandage, how clean it was,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786380,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how fast it absorbed the blood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789440,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He bolted upright and\nrushed down to the lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792320,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He thought, \"If cotton is\nso good at absorbing blood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795470,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe it'll be just as good\nat absorbing nitroglycerin.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1799430,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So inside that bandage is this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801080,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it looks like regular cotton,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802700,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you'll see it's\nnot when I light it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806000,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Woo!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809863,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I remember, yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1811490,
    "dDurationMs": 2337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching this YouTube video\nwhere they just light it on fire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813827,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the whole thing's just gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816230,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is so counterintuitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819110,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so just crazy to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821540,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823190,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure it's used in\nlike magic shows too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826200,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Woo!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1827033,
    "dDurationMs": 3297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called gun cotton or nitrocellulose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830330,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And nitrocellulose is made\nby taking cellulose polymers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833210,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say from cotton or wood pulp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1834740,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then replacing the oh,\ngroups with oxygen atoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1837680,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bonded to nitro groups, which\nare the same unstable groups"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1841280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that made nitroglycerin so explosive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843680,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now when you ignite it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1844910,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these groups rapidly break down\ninto products like nitrogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847940,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carbon dioxide, and water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849710,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of which are gases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850730,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's no particulate\nto scatter light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1853280,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why the whole thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854180,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seems to just disappear into thin air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857300,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what Alfred was interested in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858920,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was what happened when you\ncombined it with nitroglycerin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1861860,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, nitrocellulose has these\nchains that are very similar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864800,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to nitroglycerin chemically\nbecause of the nitro groups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867350,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So because of that, they mix easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869360,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now you have two\nthings that are soluble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871610,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They like each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872450,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is very different from, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874090,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kieselguhr, water and nitroglycerin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876980,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And now when you mix them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878150,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the smaller nitroglycerin molecules slip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880310,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between these long nitrocellulose chains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1882830,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trapping the nitroglycerin\nmolecules and keeping them apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885920,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like in the dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887450,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you mix in just a small\namount of nitrocellulose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890150,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get a stable moldable\ngel that resists sweating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893900,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're take a little bit\nof the nitrocellulose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896030,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a gun cotton like this much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897770,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898603,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, we're gonna\nstart with a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899920,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're gonna drop it in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901910,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see that it soaks right in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1902970,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904190,
    "dDurationMs": 1652,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Keep on adding bits\nuntil it soaks all up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905842,
    "dDurationMs": 1978,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we'll stir it around to make sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1907820,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's no dry spots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909560,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910550,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This mixture also solves\nAlfred's problem of yield."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1913400,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The matrix, like the structure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914810,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it's being held\nin is itself explosive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918140,
    "dDurationMs": 4503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now you get perfect yield,\nno sweating, ding, bang, boom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923630,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because the material is a gel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925340,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can be molded into different shapes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927200,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perfect for precise\ncontrolled mining blasts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930230,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Jesse] While it's soft like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931850,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can put it into a shape,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933260,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then when it sets,\nit'll stay that shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935870,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We enough to do a VE?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937220,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938450,
    "dDurationMs": 1053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's make a VE."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941505,
    "dDurationMs": 2994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944499,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mysterious music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1947240,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Alfred named it Gelignite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948770,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The world's first moldable explosive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951590,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With gelignite, dynamite,\nand the blasting cap in hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1955010,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred had fulfilled his oath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1957170,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had made explosives safer everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960680,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He opened factories across\nthe world, in Scotland,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963770,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "France, the United States and beyond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966080,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the early 1870s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967490,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was running more than\n90 sites in 20 countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971840,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not everyone was happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973730,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His father never recovered from\nEmil's death and just weeks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977690,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the explosion in Stockholm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979610,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immanuel suffered a stroke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981710,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He survived, but was never the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1984350,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immanuel became obsessed\nwith death, often rambling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987650,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Alfred about strange\ninventions, including a scheme"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991040,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build a network of underground tubes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1993410,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would carry corpses\ndirectly from people's homes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996740,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to giant incinerators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999680,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- His dad never had the\nsuccess that Alfred's having,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002410,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, financially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003550,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he's being lauded\nas this great inventor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2005920,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His dad, I think, is\njust jealous essentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008050,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he claims that Alfred\nhad stolen the idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2010930,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for dynamite from him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012730,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So he says to his dad,\n\"Rather than regarding this idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as your own, far from\nit, you laughed at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019510,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your fatherly love"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020470,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seems to run aground on\ncomplacency or vanity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2024040,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It should not seem strange\nthat I, at the age of 30,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2026650,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will not allow myself to\nbe treated as a schoolboy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029740,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It pains me but when it\ncomes to serious matters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032710,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've adopted the rule of acting seriously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036280,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite the confident front\nhe put up for his father,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039220,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the truth was that his wealth\nhadn't made him any happier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043000,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He says, \"I'm two steps\nahead of my competitors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2045550,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the accumulation of money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047290,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and praise leaves me totally indifferent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2050230,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My home is where I work,\nand I work everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2053290,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am a nomadic atom with\nno attachments, no roots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057190,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and no real joy in life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2060010,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1876, he couldn't take it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063190,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Overwhelmed by the\nloneliness, he placed an ad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2066340,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wealthy, highly educated,\nelderly gentleman seeks lady"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2069820,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of mature age, versed in\nlanguages as secretary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073450,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and supervisor of household."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2075640,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And into his life, entered Bertha Kinsky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078400,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She was an idealistic woman,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2080440,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "part of the Budding Peace Movement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084010,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together, they took long carriage rides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2086140,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they discussed the\nrole of science and society"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088690,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and whether it could serve\na purpose greater than war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2092110,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a moment, Alfred was happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2094570,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopeful, he asked if her heart was free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098410,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But while Alfred was away on business,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "she left to be with\nanother man in Austria."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103300,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Alfred was back to being alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106750,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred was heartbroken."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2108760,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He responded by throwing himself\neven deeper into his work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2113200,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred attempted to sell his explosives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2115060,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the French military, but\nthey weren't interested."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118480,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then a year later, when war\nbroke out between France"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2121000,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Prussia, German troops hurled dynamite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2123610,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the French positions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2125290,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Alfred received a message."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127420,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The French wanted to place an order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2130570,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One thing that I think is important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2132820,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to like think about in this moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2134530,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that people have been\nstabbed, bruised, shot with gunpowder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all this other\nstuff, but up till then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2140860,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would've been totally\nforeign to see that level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144220,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of destruction on a human body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146050,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, it would've been unmatched\nin kind of human history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2149320,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- As he starts thinking more about war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2150700,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and becoming involved with\nlike the French military,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2152410,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the German military, the Italian military."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154420,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They come to him with a problem\nthat's been plaguing them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156970,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for hundreds of years since\nthe invention of gunpowder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2159790,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is that on a\nbattlefield with black powder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2163060,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you shoot, it obscures visibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165580,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you don't really\nknow how to shoot again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2167290,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you can't aim very well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2168820,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, one thing you're\nseeing with the black powder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2170320,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that every time it explodes,\nthere's just this huge plume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2173740,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of smoke that enemy fighters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176080,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be able to see your location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178030,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's just this big problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2179380,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where there's like a literal fog of war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181360,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred starts contemplating that problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2183610,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What he thinks back to is gun cotton."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2186130,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, it doesn't create smoke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2187720,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can I use gun cotton to replace powder?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191050,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the problem with using gun cotton"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2192790,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or any high explosive mass in small arms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195370,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it detonates all at once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2197650,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "releasing its energy in a split second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2200140,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the pressure inside\nthe barrel spikes faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2202300,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the bullet can accelerate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204190,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So much of the energy is wasted as heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2206710,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of propelling the projectile,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208510,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can even destroy the barrel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211180,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What Alfred wanted was a propellant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212710,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that built pressure gradually,\nso the forest rose smoothly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215860,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the bullet traveled down the barrel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2217720,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he began experimenting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2219160,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a new nitroglycerin\nnitrocellulose mixture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2221950,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By adding 10 to 20 times\nmore nitrocellulose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2224590,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than a gelignite, he transformed it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2227050,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a jelly into a tougher substance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2229420,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that could be rolled into\npasta thin sheets in Italy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2232570,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They even used pasta makers to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2234970,
    "dDurationMs": 2004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These sheets were then stamped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2236974,
    "dDurationMs": 1206,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into countless tiny little grains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2238180,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When these grains were\npacked into a cartridge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240400,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they wouldn't fit tightly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2241720,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Small gaps of air remained between them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2243970,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that was actually a good thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2246160,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when one grain ignited, a shockwave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2248350,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "couldn't just race through\nthe entire charge at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2251200,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, each grain had\nto ignite its neighbor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2253420,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the one beside it, and\nthe next one in sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2256150,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This slowed down the burn rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257410,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and allowed the pressure\nto build gradually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259480,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they were able to replicate\nthe effect of gunpowder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2262090,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because the fuel was a\ncombination of nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264790,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and nitrocellulose, both of\nwhich broke down into clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2267610,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stable gases, it burned with little smoke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2271120,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Alfred had solved a problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2272800,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that had plagued armies for centuries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275260,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And to this day, the propellant in much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2277120,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the world's ammunition\nis still a combination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279520,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of nitroglycerin and nitrocellulose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2281680,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like Alfred's invention,\nhe called it ballistite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2285400,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world's first smokeless\nhigh energy propellant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2289510,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred quickly received an\norder for 300,000 kilograms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293470,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of ballistite from the Italian army."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2296290,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he opened a massive\narmaments factory in Italy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2299590,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and began to fall deeper\ninto the world of warfare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2303370,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He developed landmines,\nearly gun silencers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2306430,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even experimented with one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2308050,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the first rocket-powered missiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2310060,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It flew over four kilometers down range,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2312760,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and allegedly captured this image."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2317260,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The whole time, he's\nin contact with Bertha,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319600,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the woman who kind of jilted him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2321910,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she's become pretty\nimportant in the peace movement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2325060,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2326590,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She wrote this book called\n\"Lay Down Your Arms.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328750,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That became kind of a sensation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2330430,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and established these peace\ncongresses across the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2333850,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To her, he insisted, \"My\nrockets are meant not only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2336700,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for war, but also for the\nrescue of shipwrecked persons.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340420,
    "dDurationMs": 1747,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He even took it a step further."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342167,
    "dDurationMs": 1943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Perhaps my factories will put an end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2344110,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to war sooner than your congresses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346510,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the day that two army corps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348010,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can mutually annihilate\neach other in a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2350410,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All civilized nations will\nsurely recoil with horror"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2353590,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and disband their troops.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355900,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a concept that we see a lot of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2358390,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When people are sure to kill each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360430,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the modern weapons\nthat I've given them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362620,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no war will be possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364150,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also the same thing that\nwe think about in Oppenheimer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2367810,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I feel like we've heard it so many times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2370270,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you just can't believe it ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371950,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2372783,
    "dDurationMs": 1147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And then it's just marketing on the part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373930,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all these guys who are selling weapons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375880,
    "dDurationMs": 2257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't wanna come across\nas evil guys who are like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378137,
    "dDurationMs": 1553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I'm gonna make something\nthat'll help you kill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2379690,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more people than ever before.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2381340,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, that's kind of the truth of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383290,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Especially in the dynamite case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2385240,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like a tremendous\nmisjudgment of human nature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388180,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, yeah.\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2390370,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is not gonna be\nused for to stop war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2393010,
    "dDurationMs": 2991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we definitely don't see\nthat in the decades that follow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2396001,
    "dDurationMs": 1179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(jazz music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2397180,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between the 1890s and the\n1920s, over 7,000 bombings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401020,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "occurred in New York alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2403390,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine waking up, opening the paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2405280,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and seeing another explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2407110,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every other day for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410231,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sullen music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2411940,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most common perpetrators were known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2413560,
    "dDurationMs": 1203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the Dynamite Club."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2415600,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were part of a deadly\nnew political movement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417670,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the rise in America."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2419170,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They rejected industrialization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2420760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and longed for a simpler world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2423160,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, their name evokes\nchaos and destruction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426400,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the time, it was more literal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428560,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No ruler, an-ackhos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2431200,
    "dDurationMs": 1503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was anarchy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2433630,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were so crazy and so\neffective using dynamite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2437170,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Theodore Roosevelt\naddressed Congress,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2440020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he said, \"The largest\nthreat facing the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2442300,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the anarchist threat.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2443590,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Were they intentionally\njust killing people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2446260,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2447670,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their argument was that, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2449080,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if if one person dies at\nthe hands of an anarchist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2451060,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "100 people have died in\nthe industrial machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2457270,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2458103,
    "dDurationMs": 1087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These people sound crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2459190,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the entire modern practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2461410,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of terrorism using spectacular violence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2463930,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to advance a political agenda,\noften targeting civilians,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2467230,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that all began with the\nanarchists and their dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2470920,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dynamite unlocked a new scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2472810,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of destruction previously unimaginable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2475540,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With only a few sticks in a coat pocket,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2477790,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one person could walk into a\ncrowded street and wreak havoc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2481840,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What began as an industrial tool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484240,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had become a weapon of mass murder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2487150,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1927 in Bath, Michigan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2489790,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a man spent months wiring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2491590,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the town's new elementary\nschool with dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2494470,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He hid the charges in the basement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2496420,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and crawl spaces,\nconcealed them under floors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2499150,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and behind walls, all while serving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501520,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the school board treasurer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2503380,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then on the morning of May\n18th, just after classes began,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507130,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he triggered the explosives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2509530,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As parents and rescuers\nrushed to the scene,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2512080,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he arrived in a truck\npacked with more dynamite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2514720,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and shrapnel and detonated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2518500,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In all, 38 children, six\nadults, and the attacker died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2523090,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another 58 were grievously injured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2526150,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The deadliest school\nmassacre in American history"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2529030,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was not a shooting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2530950,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a dynamite attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2533800,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, Alfred\ncouldn't know all the ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2536530,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which his inventions would be abused,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2538960,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he had seen the\ndestruction in his own life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2542230,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he had heard the\npleas to change his ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545770,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in 1888, when he read that paper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2549190,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something in him broke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2552638,
    "dDurationMs": 1352,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(somber music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2553990,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a few years later, as\nhis health began to fail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557050,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as he took pellets of nitroglycerin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2559120,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to ease the pain in his chest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2561370,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he couldn't shake the thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2563320,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he called his lawyer\nand wrote a new will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2568120,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With 94% of his personal fortune,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2571060,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "31.2 million Swedish kronor\nor about $340 million today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576160,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he created a set of prizes for those who,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579790,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during the preceding\nyear, shall have conferred"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2582370,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the greatest benefit on\nmankind, the Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2586960,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were five in total."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2588250,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For chemistry, physics,\nmedicine, literature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2592930,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and finally, peace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2596657,
    "dDurationMs": 1493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(gentle music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598150,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On December 10th, 1896,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2600070,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred Nobel died in his villa in Italy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2602950,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just as he had always\nfeared, he died alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606520,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the time of his death,\nhe held 355 patents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609880,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ran an empire of 90 factories\nthat produced explosives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613480,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and armaments across the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2615850,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet, in his final act,\nhe gave his fortune away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2620020,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for an idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2622570,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So did it work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2623920,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did it redeem him in the\neyes of everyone today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2627940,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Have you ever heard\nthe name Alfred Nobel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2630310,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2631143,
    "dDurationMs": 3018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was the creator of\nthe Nobel Peace Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2634161,
    "dDurationMs": 1329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nobel Prize.\n- Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2635490,
    "dDurationMs": 1428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nobel Prize.\n- Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2636918,
    "dDurationMs": 1373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nobel Prize.\n- Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2638291,
    "dDurationMs": 1631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nobel Prize.\n- Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2639922,
    "dDurationMs": 1218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2641140,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Anything else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2644650,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I should know more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2645760,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The Nobel Prize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2646900,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is that it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2648790,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2649623,
    "dDurationMs": 1537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm saying like nothing like dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2651160,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't think about that at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2652360,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Dynamite?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2653200,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2654033,
    "dDurationMs": 1177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He also invented dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2655210,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Did not know that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2656080,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I didn't know about the dynamite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2657160,
    "dDurationMs": 1823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I knew about the Peace\nPrize, but that's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2658983,
    "dDurationMs": 2901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think the attempt has\nbeen to have him portrayed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2661884,
    "dDurationMs": 2276,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as somebody who tried to promote"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2665500,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new understanding and advances in science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2669940,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that's-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2671260,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's his legacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2672340,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2673330,
    "dDurationMs": 873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It would seem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675400,
    "dDurationMs": 2483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I mean, if you're cynical,\nyou say it's a PR move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2678850,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And are you inclined to be cynical?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2680800,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think it must be at\nleast somewhat a PR move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2684280,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To me, like Nobel Prize\nhas always been like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686290,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pinnacle of achievement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2687820,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If anyone wins the Nobel\nPrizes, like, yeah, you're done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2690100,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that's all you need\nto accomplish in life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2692410,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, in some ways, like\nmaybe he was in control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2694720,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of his legacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2696160,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, and he took control of his legacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2698200,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2699033,
    "dDurationMs": 2197,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He decided he wanted it\nto be a positive thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2701230,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a twisted irony to the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2703810,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When Alfred Nobel created\ndynamite, he was trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2706420,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make explosive safer to prevent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2708400,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the kind of accident\nthat killed his brother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2710560,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But by making nitroglycerin\neasier to handle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2713200,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he also made it more accessible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2715330,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that made it more deadly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2717910,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why then did he create the Nobel Prizes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2720571,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it out of the goodness of his heart?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2722590,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or a desire to redeem himself in the eyes of everyone\nwho would come after?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2727720,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2729010,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the idea that anyone anywhere\ncan be recognised"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2731470,
    "dDurationMs": 2898,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for advancing science,\nliterature or peace"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2734368,
    "dDurationMs": 996,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is beautiful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2735364,
    "dDurationMs": 2862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 'This award is not just a piece of metal\nthat you would wear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2738226,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an award that you would keep in your room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2740356,
    "dDurationMs": 3728,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but, this is really an encouragement for me\nto go forward and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2744084,
    "dDurationMs": 835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to believe in myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2744919,
    "dDurationMs": 2362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To know that there are people\nwho are supporting me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2747281,
    "dDurationMs": 1397,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this campaign.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2748666,
    "dDurationMs": 3326,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe it doesn't matter why he did it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2751992,
    "dDurationMs": 3013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only that he did."
    } ]
  } ]
}
